54	 * {@link ChainOfTrustProof#wrapsProof()} to establish chain of trust from the genesis address book hash.
55	 * The state machine moves first through a signing protocol that forms an aggregate signature from three
56	 * rounds of exchanging WRAPS messages; and then runs a heavy compression step to form a succinct proof.
57	 */
58	public class WrapsHistoryProver implements HistoryProver {
